      "value": "<p>You gain a bonus to Constitution saving throws equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of +1). In addition, once per turn when you hit a creature with an attack roll while transformed by Wrath of the Wild, you regain Hit Points equal to 1d10 plus your Wisdom modifier, provided you are Bloodied when you hit.</p>",
